                        "entry_id": "9981ab86-7054-3ebf-82bd-0ab564ccd26f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having a tendency to steal."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d60b0a99-9f9a-477d-a953-720134f2faa6",
                                "sense_id": "c601c357-7964-3e7d-9377-47ab0cee59ed",
                                "text": "I tel you true my hart is ſwolne with wrath,\nOn this ſame theeuish villain Tamburlain.\nAnd of that false Coſroe, my traiterous brother,\nWould it not grieue a King to be so abuſ’d?\nAnd haue a thouſand horſmen tane away?"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "db985caa-8910-3522-b941-a1968133950b",
                        "entry_id": "9981ab86-7054-3ebf-82bd-0ab564ccd26f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having the manner of a thief; furtive; stealthy."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "79aeb575-8bf6-417d-a95b-5197fe3dc3db",
                                "sense_id": "db985caa-8910-3522-b941-a1968133950b",
                                "text": "What, wouldst thou have me go and beg my food,\nOr with a base and boist'rous sword enforce\nA thievish living on the common road?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
